Package: noxis-shell
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 3rr0r <https://github.com/Real3rr0r303YT>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: cage, libpam-modules, libpam-runtime, adduser, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, librsvg2-common, phosh, wlr-randr, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: plymouth, fonts-inter, gnome-network-displays
Conflicts: phrog
Provides: x-display-manager
Description: Noxis Linux – login, branding and desktop mode
 Own display manager (noxis-dm, PAM + logind) with a GTK4 greeter in
 cage: first-boot language/time zone setup (de tr en fr bg ru uk),
 shuffled PIN pad, lockout after failed attempts, status and session
 icons. Noxis logos, wallpapers, Plymouth boot splash and automatic
 desktop mode for external displays (wlr-randr, on-screen keyboard off).
